  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBQA-F102-AL" ;
  triage:title "Architecture test entrenches RBQA-F101 duplication instead of catching it" ;
  triage:description "The AL.9 architecture test al9_cli_and_graft_send_use_the_selected_runtime_client (boundary_enforcement.rs around line 2058) asserts that the duplicate selected_write_transport method exists in BOTH crates/atm/src/composition.rs and crates/atm-graft/src/lib.rs, entrenching RBQA-F101-AL rather than catching it. Needs rewriting alongside any RBQA-F101-AL fix so it asserts a single shared owner instead of asserting duplication. Depends on RBQA-F101-AL fix landing first." ;
